  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Another game based on the animé series Saint Seiya. The animé (and the game) tells the story of the noble Bronze Saints who have to save the goddess Athena, the only benevolent deity among the rivaling Greek gods. In the game, you control four Bronze Saints: Pegasus Seiya, Cygnus Hyoga, Dragon Shiryu, and Andromedus Shun. At specific parts of the game, you'll have to choose a specific character in order to trigger a story-related event.\r\n\r\nThe gameplay is split into side-scrolling action and RPG-like turn-based fights. During the side-view sequences you travel through short levels, beating up goons who are trying to stop you, jumping and trying not to fall into the abyss. You accumulate experience points, called &quot;Seven Senses&quot;, which you can then distribute to raise your HP or Cosmo Power. Cosmo is a kind of energy you need to perform an attack, and it decreases the more you fight. In the end of a level, a boss usually awaits you, whom you fight in turn-based style, performing punches and kicks."
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "Saint Seiya - Ougon Densetsu Kanketsu Hen sur Nes est un jeu d'action inspiré du dessin animé Les Chevaliers du Zodiaque. Vous contrôlez à tour de rôle les 4 chevaliers de Bronze qui doivent une fois de plus sauver la princesse Athéna. Le jeu est divisé en deux parties, une de plates-formes simple et l'autre plus axée jeu de rôle."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Saint Seiya - Ougon Densetsu Kanketsu Hen on Nes ist ein Actionspiel, das vom Zeichentrickfilm Knights of the Zodiac inspiriert wurde. Sie steuern abwechselnd die 4 Bronzeritter, die erneut Prinzessin Athene retten müssen. Das Spiel ist in zwei Teile unterteilt, einen mit einfachen Plattformen und einen, der sich mehr auf Rollenspiele konzentriert."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "Este juego de la franquicia Saint Seiya tampoco apareció en España. Se desarrolla durante la etapa de la batalla de las 12 casas y hay que enfrentarse a los caballeros de oro. Puedes escoger entre: Seiya de Pegaso, Shiryu del Dragón, Hyoga del Cisne o Shun de Andrómeda para completar el camino. Curiosamente el final de el juego no es el mismo del anime ya que fue editado antes de la conclusión de este arco argumental."
    },
    {
      "langue": "it",
      "text": "Un altro gioco basato sulla serie animata Saint Seiya. L'anime (e il gioco) racconta la storia dei nobili Cavalieri di Bronzo che devono salvare la dea Atena, l'unica divinità benevola tra le divinità greche rivali. Nel gioco controlli quattro Cavalieri di Bronzo: Pegasus, Cristal, Sirio e Andromedus. In parti specifiche del gioco, dovrai scegliere un personaggio specifico per attivare un evento legato alla storia."
    },
    {
      "langue": "pt",
      "text": "Outro jogo baseado na série animé Saint Seiya. O animé (e o jogo) conta a história dos nobres Cavaleiros de Bronze que têm de salvar a deusa Atena, a única divindade benevolente entre os deuses gregos rivais."
    }
  ],
